# Captures, not baselines. A parity run shoots BOTH sides in one sitting and
# compares them there and then — there is no long-lived reference image to keep,
# and a shot from last month would only be compared against a page that has
# legitimately moved since. What survives a run is the verdict, in the wave's
# commit message or in a bug file. Regenerate with capture-sunwalk.mjs.
